OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA band of
OL,6,Frain will edge erratically southwards,
OL,7,Fstalling over the region to bring
OL,8,Fextensive low cloud and some heavier
OL,9,Fpulses of rain. Warm and humid,
OL,10,Ffeeling more so later as the breeze
OL,11,Fweakens and rain eases.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FCloudy, humid and damp, with
OL,14,Fsome rain and drizzle. Drier generally
OL,15,Flater, but sunny intervals perhaps
OL,16,Fsparking a few moderate, and often
OL,17,Fquite drizzly, showers. Brightest in
OL,18,Fthe north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
